---
source: crates/core/tests/distros.rs
expression: "tasks_plan(&sys, ids)"
---
Bootcraft plan for Debian (11 tasks)

[1/11] Let burce use sudo  (debian.sudo)
    $ apt-get install -y sudo
    $ usermod -aG sudo burce

[2/11] Enable contrib and non-free  (debian.sources)
    $ edit /etc/apt/sources.list.d/debian.sources: add the contrib, non-free, non-free-firmware components to every source (if the file exists)
    $ edit /etc/apt/sources.list: add the contrib, non-free, non-free-firmware components to every source (if the file exists)

[3/11] Update the system  (system.update)
    $ env DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive apt-get -y -o Dpkg::Options::=--force-confdef -o Dpkg::Options::=--force-confold -o DPkg::Lock::Timeout=300 update
    $ env DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive apt-get -y -o Dpkg::Options::=--force-confdef -o Dpkg::Options::=--force-confold -o DPkg::Lock::Timeout=300 full-upgrade

[4/11] NVIDIA driver (Debian's 550)  (gpu.nvidia)
    $ apt-get install -y linux-headers-amd64 nvidia-kernel-dkms nvidia-driver firmware-misc-nonfree

[5/11] Hardware video decoding on NVIDIA  (gpu.nvidia-vaapi)
    $ apt-get install -y nvidia-vaapi-driver

[6/11] Flatpak with Flathub  (flatpak.flathub)
    $ apt-get install -y flatpak plasma-discover-backend-flatpak
    $ flatpak remote-add --if-not-exists --system flathub https://dl.flathub.org/repo/flathub.flatpakrepo

[7/11] Media codecs and thumbnails  (media.codecs)
    $ apt-get install -y ffmpeg gstreamer1.0-libav gstreamer1.0-plugins-good gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad gstreamer1.0-plugins-ugly gstreamer1.0-vaapi ffmpegthumbnailer

[8/11] Archive tools  (tools.archive)
    $ apt-get install -y 7zip unrar unzip zip

[9/11] NTFS and exFAT drives  (tools.drives)
    $ apt-get install -y ntfs-3g exfatprogs

[10/11] Fonts for every language and emoji  (system.fonts)
    $ apt-get install -y fonts-noto-core fonts-noto-cjk fonts-noto-color-emoji

[11/11] Firmware updates  (system.firmware)
    $ apt-get install -y fwupd

A reboot is required afterwards.
